              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: blunt, crooked, flat, hollow, dim]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "chickpeas, mustard seeds, coriander leaves, curry leaves, buttermilk",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: chickpeas, mustard seeds, coriander leaves, curry leaves, buttermilk]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hard? (కఠినమైన, kaṭhinamaina.) Special? (ప్రత్యేక, pratyēka.) Convenient? (అనుకూలమైన, anukūlamaina.) Useful? (ఉపయోగకరమైన, upayōgakaramaina.) Local? (స్థానిక, sthānika.) Stubborn? (మొండి, moṇḍi.) Stingy? (పిసినారి, pisināri.) Active? (చురుకైన, curukaina.) Naughty? (అల్లరి, allari.) Honesty? (నిజాయితీ, nijāyitī.) Blunt? (మొద్దు, moddu.) Crooked? (వంకర, vaṅkara.) Flat? (చదునైన, cadunaina.) Hollow? (బోలు, bōlu.) Dim? (మసక, masaka.) Chickpeas? (శనగలు, śanagalu.) Mustard seeds? (ఆవాలు, āvālu.) Coriander leaves? (కొత్తిమీర, kottimīra.) Curry leaves? (కరివేపాకు, karivēpāku.) Buttermilk? (మజ్జిగ, majjiga.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
